[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_PERFUME_BUSINESS]
Canterlot Luxury Perfume

[en.FOCUS_C01_C02_PERFUME_BUSINESS_desc]
We will start a new brand, Canterlot Luxury Perfume, selling this magical sleep-inducing perfume and promoting it in the name of the Empress.\nWe expect profits to be very high. What? You ask what this has to do with secret weapon against Ponyville? Well, let me think... we would make a lot of money from Ponyville, right?

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C02_PERFUME_BUSINESS]
坎特洛特高档香水

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C02_PERFUME_BUSINESS_desc]
我们将创立新品牌，坎特洛特高档香水，出售这种神奇的助眠香水，并以女皇的名义进行宣传。\n我们预计利润将会很高。什么？你问这和对付小马谷的秘密武器有什么关系？额... 让我想想，总之我们从小马谷那里应该能赚到不少钱？

